message: >-
  Jika Anda menggunakan proyek ini dalam riset, tugas akademik, atau bahan ajar,
  mohon sitasi seperti di bawah ini dan sebutkan keterbatasan dataset sesuai
  bagian Limitations pada berkas .md dataset. / If you use this project, please
  cite it as below and mention the dataset's documented limitations.
title: "Tempest–Eastern Empire War Map: Campaign Atlas and Battlefield Timeline"
abstract: >-
  An interactive reconstruction of the Tempest–Eastern Empire War from the light
  novel series "Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken" (volumes 12–16): fifty campaign
  days, six theatres and 7,200 ten-minute keyframes of battlefield state, rendered
  on a globe. The project separates source-stated facts from simulation
  reconstructions at the column level, keeps unknown values as UNKNOWN, and
  verifies its timeline with a machine-checkable temporal constraint graph.
  Non-commercial fan project; not affiliated with the rights holders of the
  original work.
